# Bennett Furina Xiangling Xianyun. ~20s Rot. Xianyun Furinational. Furina -> XL -> Bennett -> Xianyun -> Bennett; No Hydro VV. Pyro Application is overwhleming with XL EQ + Bennett's special fast plunge spam & skills off CD for XL energy. Few Bennett plunge Vapes. CW > MH Bennett. 50% Collsions.

